ing pressure. It leaves a balanced remaining hand with a clear plan: play the straight (6-10), then the pair sequence (JJ-QQ), and close with the high pair (AA) and top single (2).\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦3", "♠K", "♥K", "♦K"]}'}
